227 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (What happens in the example is the trader enters a trade with not only a poor trading system \(Identified by their lack of an exit plan\) but also poor emotional control given they stayed in the trade all the way into profit and back into a loss. The key emotions at play here are: Greed, Fear, overconfidence and regret, but what lessons can we take from this.)
